### Order Management System - API requests
#
# Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
# and click "Send Request" above any block. Run the login first: it stores the
# token in @token, which every request below reuses.
#
# Point @host at the live demo instead of localhost to try it without running
# anything locally.

@host = http://localhost:3000
# @host = http://194.233.85.160:3000


### Sign in
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mozahid.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}


### Who am I
GET {{host}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------- Products

### List every product
GET {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### List only the ones on sale (what the counter uses)
GET {{host}}/products?enabled=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Create a product
# @name createProduct
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk Powder 500g",
  "description": "Dairy - instant powder",
  "price": 500,
  "weight": 500
}

###
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}


### Edit it
PATCH {{host}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 520
}


### Hide it from the counter
PATCH {{host}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------ Promotions

### List promotions with their slabs
GET {{host}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Weighted - the worked example from the brief.
### A 500g product: 12 units is 6000g, which lands in slab 2 at 3 tk each = 36 tk.
POST {{host}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Milk Powder Weighted Slabs",
  "type": "WEIGHTED",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "slabs": [
    { "minWeight": 1000,  "maxWeight": 5500,  "discountPerUnit": 2 },
    { "minWeight": 6000,  "maxWeight": 8500,  "discountPerUnit": 3 },
    { "minWeight": 9000,  "maxWeight": 11500, "discountPerUnit": 4 },
    { "minWeight": 12000,                     "discountPerUnit": 5 }
  ]
}


### Percentage
POST {{host}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ten percent off",
  "type": "PERCENTAGE",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "percentageValue": 10
}


### Fixed amount per unit
POST {{host}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fifteen taka off",
  "type": "FIXED",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "fixedValue": 15
}


### Only the title and dates may change once a promotion exists
PATCH {{host}}/promotions/PROMOTION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Renamed promotion",
  "endDate": "2026-11-30"
}


### Pause one
PATCH {{host}}/promotions/PROMOTION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orders

### List orders with their line items
GET {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Place an order - expect subtotal 6000, discount 36, grand total 5964
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Rahim Uddin",
  "customerPhone": "01711223344",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 12 }
  ]
}


### ------------------------------------------------------- Rejected inputs

### No token - 401
GET {{host}}/products


### Wrong password - 401, and the message never says which field was wrong
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mozahid.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}


### Quantity above the cap - 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test",
  "customerPhone": "01700000000",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 999999 }
  ]
}


### Empty cart - 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test",
  "customerPhone": "01700000000",
  "items": []
}
